-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative block w-full cursor-pointer rounded-xl px-6 py-4 text-left outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-400 dark:focus-visible:ring-zinc-500\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 md:text-2xl\">Golden Hour</h3><div class=\"overflow-hidden\" style=\"height:auto;opacity:1\"><p class=\"pt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">The last light of the day spilling across the coast, when the water turns to brass and every ridge catches fire.</p></div></button></div><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative block w-full cursor-pointer rounded-xl px-6 py-4 text-left outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-400 dark:focus-visible:ring-zinc-500\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 md:text-2xl\">Forest Stream</h3><div class=\"overflow-hidden\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:1\"><p class=\"pt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">A cold stream threading through moss and old growth, quiet except for the water finding its way downhill.</p></div></button></div><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative block w-full cursor-pointer rounded-xl px-6 py-4 text-left outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-400 dark:focus-visible:ring-zinc-500\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 md:text-2xl\">Sunset Cliffs</h3><div class=\"overflow-hidden\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:1\"><p class=\"pt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Sheer cliffs dropping into the sea as the sun sinks, the rock face glowing long after the beach is in shadow.